A bones file is not related to a complete dungeon in a game rather to
individual levels. Bones files are randomly stored and randomly loaded.
The main condition is that the level number and dungeon branch of a
stored bones file matches with a level that you visit; this is decided
when you enter a new level. If there are no stored bones files for the
respective level there's no chance. OTOH, there can be many bones files
loaded into a single game.

